# Fonts — licensed, deliberately NOT committed (yet)
#
# Playoff Pro Cond and Benton Sans are Monotype-licensed. A desktop licence
# generally does not cover webfont self-hosting, and committing these to a
# repo that publishes via GitHub Pages serves them to anyone who loads the
# page — which is redistribution. A private repo does not help if Pages is
# public.
#
# They live in public/fonts/ locally, so `npm run dev` looks right. A CI build
# will not have them and the app falls back to system fonts, which degrades
# gracefully rather than breaking.
#
# Once the webfont licence is confirmed, delete these two lines and commit the
# files. Nothing in the code needs to change.
public/fonts/*.woff2
public/fonts/*.otf
public/fonts/*.ttf
